ferrisfetch (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add structured JSON output flag (--json).
  * Fix GPU detection: parse system pci.ids and prevent ACPI motherboard label override.
  * Add context-aware host and WSL2 environment detection.
  * Add Homebrew and Gentoo Emerge package managers.
  * Add ASCII art logos for NixOS, Kali, FreeBSD, Slackware, Artix, and Zorin OS.

 -- FerrisFetch Packaging Team <packaging@ferrisfetch.rs>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 07:00:00 +0000

ferrisfetch (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release (0.1.0).
  * Fast, lightweight Linux system information fetch tool written in Rust.
  * Native /proc and /sys system collectors without external runtime dependencies.
  * ANSI 256-color distro ASCII art and customizable module ordering.
  * Shell completions for Bash, Zsh, and Fish.

 -- FerrisFetch Packaging Team <packaging@ferrisfetch.rs>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
